<rte>
  <name>Strada della Forra — SP38, Lake Garda (plain GPX)</name>
  <desc>Distance: 16 km (Porto di Tremosine to Pieve); 40 km for the full Lake Garda loop
Best for: Short, intense experience riding, James Bond fans, Lake Garda day trips
Best time: April to June, September to October (weekdays only)
Scenic Motorcycle Navigation App
  </desc>
